# Headers for the masked (statically served) well-known files. _headers only
# applies to static/200 responses, never to the 3xx rules in _redirects --
# which is exactly why the CORS-sensitive matrix files are masked instead of
# redirected. Matrix web clients (e.g. Element Web) fetch matrix/client
# cross-origin, so it must carry Access-Control-Allow-Origin. The files have
# no extension, so Content-Type must be set explicitly too.
/.well-known/matrix/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Content-Type: application/json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
